WEBVTT

00:03:59.076 --> 00:04:01.603
wateja wanazidi kutohusiana

00:04:01.627 --> 00:04:04.385
na wakulima wao na uchumi wa 
uzalishaji chakula

00:04:04.906 --> 00:04:07.221
Toka kuibuka kwa 
mapinduzi ya simu janja

00:04:07.245 --> 00:04:10.058
huduma ya bidhaa moja kwa moja kwa mteja
imefifia

00:04:12.081 --> 00:04:17.208
Lakini vyakula vya eneo husika na endelevu
vimeshika chati kwa miaka karibia kumi,

00:04:17.232 --> 00:04:19.209
maneno kama "ya kiafya" na "asilia"

00:04:19.233 --> 00:04:21.721
hayana mfumo wa kisheria nchini Marekani.

00:04:22.371 --> 00:04:26.088
Unataka kubahatisha chakula kizuri chenye
virutubisho vingi

00:04:26.112 --> 00:04:27.675
bila maneno ya wauzaji?

00:04:28.378 --> 00:04:29.733
Nenda kwenye soko lako la wakulima.